sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ARCtrl as AgentRuntime<br/>Controller
    participant Webhook as Mutating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CRCtrl as ClientRegistration<br/>Reconciler
    participant Keycloak as Keycloak<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ACSyncCtrl as AgentCard Sync<br/>Controller
    participant ACCtrl as AgentCard<br/>Controller
    participant AgentPod as Agent Pod<br/>with AuthBridge
    participant SPIRE as SPIRE Trust Bundle<br/>In-process
    participant NPCtrl as NetworkPolicy<br/>Controller
    participant BundleSvc as Bundle Service<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ExtClient as External Client
    participant TokenBroker as Token Broker<br/>8080/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Keycloak: Flow 1: Agent Enrollment via AgentRuntime
        User->>K8sAPI: Create AgentRuntime CR
        K8sAPI->>ARCtrl: Watch event (AgentRuntime)
        ARCtrl->>K8sAPI: Patch Deployment labels<br/>(kagenti.io/type)
        ARCtrl->>K8sAPI: Compute config-hash annotation
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Pod CREATE event
        Webhook->>Webhook: Inject AuthBridge sidecars<br/>(proxy + SPIFFE + init)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Pod spec
        ARCtrl->>CRCtrl: Trigger client registration
        CRCtrl->>Keycloak: Register client<br/>(HTTP, admin credentials)
        Keycloak-->>CRCtrl: Client ID + Secret
        CRCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create per-agent Secret
        ARCtrl->>ACSyncCtrl: Trigger card sync
        ACSyncCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create AgentCard CR
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over ACCtrl,NPCtrl: Flow 2: Agent Card Verification
        K8sAPI->>ACCtrl: Watch event (AgentCard)
        ACCtrl->>AgentPod: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json<br/>(HTTP/mTLS)
        AgentPod-->>ACCtrl: Agent card JSON + JWS signature
        ACCtrl->>SPIRE: Verify JWS signature<br/>(X.509 SVID trust bundle)
        SPIRE-->>ACCtrl: Verification result
        ACCtrl->>ACCtrl: Evaluate SPIFFE identity binding
        ACCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update AgentCard status<br/>(verified/unverified)
        K8sAPI->>NPCtrl: Watch event (AgentCard status)
        NPCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>(permissive or restrictive)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over ExtClient,TokenBroker: Flow 3: AuthBridge Runtime Token Exchange
        ExtClient->>AgentPod: Request (Bearer JWT)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/mTLS
        AgentPod->>AgentPod: AuthBridge validates JWT<br/>(JWKS endpoint fetch, 443/TCP HTTPS)
        AgentPod->>AgentPod: Forward to agent container<br/>(localhost, validated token)
        AgentPod->>AgentPod: Agent outbound request<br/>(forward proxy, 8081/TCP)
        AgentPod->>Keycloak: RFC 8693 token exchange<br/>(client credentials)
        Keycloak-->>AgentPod: Exchanged token
        AgentPod->>ExtClient: Response with exchanged Bearer
        Note over AgentPod,BundleSvc: IBAC Policy Evaluation
        AgentPod->>BundleSvc: Fetch OPA policy bundle<br/>(per SPIFFE ID)
        BundleSvc-->>AgentPod: Authorization policy bundle
        AgentPod->>AgentPod: OPA evaluate per-request
    end
